# Tududi (Danathar/tududi fork)

Fork rule: this repository is `Danathar/tududi`, a fork of `chrisvel/tududi`.
PRs and issues go to this fork. Pass `--repo Danathar/tududi` to every
`gh pr`, `gh issue`, `gh release` and `gh workflow` command; never target
`chrisvel/tududi`, and push only to `origin`. Full rules: `AGENTS.md`, section
"This repository is a fork. All work happens here." (it wins over this file).
Codebase guide: `CLAUDE.md`.

## Commands (root `package.json`)

- Dev: `npm start` (frontend :8080, backend :3002), after `npm run db:init`.
- Checks: `npm run lint`, `npm run format`, `npm test`,
  `npm run frontend:test`, `npm run build`, `npm run backend:test:upgrade`.
- PostgreSQL: `npm run backend:test:pg` with `DATABASE_URL` set.
- Migrations: `npm run migration:create <name>`, `npm run db:migrate`,
  `npm run migration:status`.
- PR #9 reported `npm run frontend:test` failing on a clean `main` for
  `MermaidDiagram`, `MarkdownRenderer.publicLinks`, `roleLabels` (historical).
  Rerun a failing suite on current `main` before calling it pre-existing.

## Code

- Backend: `backend/modules/<feature>/` with `routes.js` (thin) ->
  `repository.js` (Sequelize) and optional `operations/`, `core/`. Routes never
  use models directly. Register new modules in `backend/app.js`.
- Frontend: React 18 + TypeScript; global state in `frontend/store/useStore.ts`,
  server data via SWR, API calls via `frontend/utils/<resource>Service.ts`.
- Prettier: 4 spaces, single quotes, semicolons, ES5 trailing commas.
- Add or update tests with every behaviour change (`backend/tests/unit`,
  `backend/tests/integration`).

## Migrations

Every new migration runs on SQLite and PostgreSQL. Use the `safe*` helpers in
`backend/utils/migration-utils.js`; no `PRAGMA`, `sqlite_master`,
`AUTOINCREMENT`, backtick identifiers or `0`/`1` booleans. See
`docs/database.md`, "Writing dialect-safe migrations".

## Translations

Source: `public/locales/en/translation.json`. Add each new key to all 25 locale
folders under `public/locales/`. No sync script exists.

## Licence and versions

GPL-3.0-only fork. Never edit or delete `LICENSE.MIT`; do not revert licence
identifiers to MIT or ISC; do not bump the `package.json` version; no scheduled
upstream sync; image is `ghcr.io/danathar/tududi`. Conventional Commit
messages; no `git commit -s`.

Other agent files are listed in the "Agent tooling" section of `AGENTS.md`.
